<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>메인 페이지</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background: #f3f6fb;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 400px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: white;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      text-align: center;
    }
    h1 { margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .btn {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 1.1em;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.18s;
    }
    .btn-logout { background: #e74c3c; color: #fff; }
    .btn-logout:hover { background: #c0392b; }
    .btn-edit { background: #27ae60; color: #fff; }
    .btn-edit:hover { background: #219150; }
    .btn-download { background: #3498db; color: #fff; }
    .btn-download:hover { background: #217dbb; }
    .welcome {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      font-size: 1.3em;
      color: #2c3e50;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="welcome"><%= id %>님 반갑습니다! 🎉</div>
    <button class="btn btn-edit" onclick="location.href='/edit_user?id=<%= id %>'">회원정보 수정</button>
    <a href="/api/v1/download/for_test.txt" class="btn btn-download">파일 다운로드</a>
    <button class="btn btn-logout" onclick="location.href='/api/v1/logout'">로그아웃</button>
    <p style="margin-top:18px;color:#888;">이곳은 로그인한 사용자만 접근 가능한 메인 페이지입니다.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
